# Git Bash rewrites a container -e HOME=/tmp into a Windows path, so
# chromium writes its profile into the bind mount under a directory named
# with a private-use stand-in for the illegal colon. Pass MSYS_NO_PATHCONV=1
# to avoid it; ignored here so it can never be committed again.
